        "tag": "title",
        "text": "23"
      },
      {
        "y": 24.7,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 364.2,
        "tag": "title",
        "text": "Food: a recipe for disaster"
      },
      {
        "y": 70.7,
        "x0": 75.1,
        "x1": 238.1,
        "tag": "title",
        "text": "A Describing food products"
      },
      {
        "y": 100.9,
        "x0": 109.2,
        "x1": 499.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Food production has become increasingly industrialised and globalised, and so knowing what"
      },
      {
        "y": 113.9,
        "x0": 109.2,
        "x1": 504.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "our food contains has become more and more important. Labels do not always help. Adjectives"
      },
      {
        "y": 125.8,
        "x0": 109.2,
        "x1": 509.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "such as ‘wholesome1’, ‘farm fresh’ and ‘homemade’ can be rather vague and meaningless, while"
      },
      {
        "y": 138.8,
        "x0": 109.2,
        "x1": 499.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "the international numbering system for additives2 is often incomprehensible to people. Some"
      },
      {
        "y": 151.8,
        "x0": 109.2,
        "x1": 488.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "familiar descriptions, however, do have a clear official meaning, for example ‘wholefoods3’,"
      },
      {
        "y": 164.8,
        "x0": 109.2,
        "x1": 509.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "‘free-range4 eggs’, ‘gluten-free5 bread’ or ‘contains no artificial colours or preservatives6’. Clear"
      },
      {
        "y": 177.8,
        "x0": 109.2,
        "x1": 498,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "and scientifically accurate descriptions can be vital for people who suffer from food allergies7"
      },
      {
        "y": 190.8,
        "x0": 109.2,
        "x1": 501.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "and for vegetarians or vegans8 who want to know exactly what is in a product, as well as being"
      },
      {
        "y": 203.8,
        "x0": 109.2,
        "x1": 501.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "important for consumers looking for natural or unprocessed9 foods, or those concerned about"
      },
      {
        "y": 216.8,
        "x0": 109.2,
        "x1": 503.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "animal welfare10 who may wish to avoid food produced by battery-farming11 methods and so"
      },
      {
        "y": 229.8,
        "x0": 109.2,
        "x1": 510.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "on. With the growth in popularity of convenience foods12, alongside public health concerns over"
      },
      {
        "y": 242.8,
        "x0": 109.2,
        "x1": 509.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "bad diet and obesity, simple and unambiguous nutrition labels13 are more important than ever."
      },
      {
        "y": 255.8,
        "x0": 109.2,
        "x1": 497.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "An example of a simple system is traffic-light labelling14, which indicates high (red), medium"
      },
      {
        "y": 269.9,
        "x0": 109.2,
        "x1": 503.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "(amber) or low (green) levels of such things as fat, sugar and salt. Finally, good labelling tells us"
      },
      {
        "y": 281.8,
        "x0": 109.2,
        "x1": 493.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "where the food was produced and under what conditions, for example fair trade15 products."
      },
      {
        "y": 306.9,
        "x0": 102.2,
        "x1": 155,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 good for you"
      },
      {
        "y": 318.9,
        "x0": 102.2,
        "x1": 393.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "2 substance added to food to improve its taste or appearance or to preserve it"
      },
      {
        "y": 330.9,
        "x0": 102.2,
        "x1": 478,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "3 foods that have not had any of their natural features taken away or any artificial substances added"
      },
      {
        "y": 342.9,
        "x0": 102.2,
        "x1": 490.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "4 produced by farm animals that are allowed to move around outside and are not kept in cages or stalls"
      },
      {
        "y": 354.9,
        "x0": 102.2,
        "x1": 391.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "5 not containing a protein which is contained in wheat and some other grains"
      },
      {
        "y": 366.9,
        "x0": 102.2,
        "x1": 268.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "6 chemicals used to stop food from decaying"
      },
      {
        "y": 378.9,
        "x0": 102.2,
        "x1": 504.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "7 condition that makes a person become ill or develop skin or breathing problems because they have eaten"
      },
      {
        "y": 389.7,
        "x0": 107.3,
        "x1": 420.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "certain foods or been near certain substances. The related adjective is allergic (to)."
      },
      {
        "y": 400.9,
        "x0": 102.2,
        "x1": 436.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "8 person who does not eat or use any animal products, such as meat, fish, eggs or cheese"
      },
      {
        "y": 412.9,
        "x0": 102.2,
        "x1": 474.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "9 which have not been treated with chemicals that preserve them or give them extra taste or colour"
      },
      {
        "y": 424.9,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 190.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "10 taking care of animals"
      },
      {
        "y": 436.9,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 513.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "11 system of producing a large quantity of eggs or meat cheaply by keeping a lot of birds in rows of small cages"
      },
      {
        "y": 448.9,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 323.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "12 foods that are almost ready to eat or are quick to prepare"
      },
      {
        "y": 460.9,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 317.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "13 labels that indicate how the food influences your health"
      },
      {
        "y": 472.9,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 369,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "14 labels with colours like traffic lights that give information on nutrition"
      },
      {
        "y": 484.9,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 490.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "15 a way of buying and selling products that makes certain that the original producer receives a fair price"
      },
      {
        "y": 507.8,
        "x0": 74.7,
        "x1": 189.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "B Food metaphors"
      },
      {
        "y": 525.6,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 520.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Inviting Sophie and her ex-husband to the same party was a recipe for disaster. [situation sure to lead to]"
      },
      {
        "y": 537.6,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 489.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "When asked why he didn’t turn up to the exam, he cooked up a story about his kitchen being"
      },
      {
        "y": 549.8,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 212.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "flooded. [made up, invented]"
      },
      {
        "y": 561.6,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 438.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "The film has all the ingredients of a box office hit. [all the necessary characteristics]"
      },
      {
        "y": 573.6,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 486.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "I’m not going to call him. I’m going to let him stew for another few days at least. [worry or suffer,"
      },
      {
        "y": 585.6,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 479.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "especially about something you think is that person’s fault; you can also say stew in your own juice]"
      },
      {
        "y": 597.6,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 484.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "It’s kind of you to invite me, but ballet isn’t really my cup of tea. [not the type of thing that I like]"
      },
      {
        "y": 609.6,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 472.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "The police grilled the suspect for hours, but eventually let him go. [asked a lot of questions]"
      },
      {
        "y": 621.6,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 497.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "I’m sure this is going to be another of his half-baked schemes that will never come to anything."
      },
      {
        "y": 634.7,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 267.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "[unrealistic or not thought through properly]"
      },
      {
        "y": 645.6,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 430.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Let’s hire a karaoke machine – that’ll spice up the office party. [make more lively]"
      },
      {
        "y": 657.6,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 492.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Rick has started hanging around with some unsavoury characters. [unpleasant, morally offensive]"
      },
      {
        "y": 669.6,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 458,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "They started their business with high hopes but things soon turned sour. [went wrong]"
      },
      {
        "y": 681.6,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 443.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Let’s go for a coffee and you can tell me all the juicy gossip. [exciting and interesting]"
      }
    ],
